Subject: [PATCH] Port package-list column sizing to Classic WinUI

Add fixed saved widths, resize handles, horizontal scrolling, and a fit-to-window mode.

Upstream-Commit: 46692b44fc0cae1e5c1bccfb0df11c3c3e8e9217
Upstream-PR: Devolutions/UniGetUI#5668

